    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO MoveTowardsObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectCloseEnough? THEN\n\t\t\tDO PickUpObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSELECTOR\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectRound? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO StartRotatingObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectSquare? THEN\n\t\t\t\t\tDO StartInspectingObject\n\t\t\tEND\n\t\t\tDO ReturnObject\n\t\tEND\n\tEND\n"
